OL,3,GNEWSASevere delays on M25 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced severe delays on the
OL,7,FM25 in Surrey earlier on Wednesday
OL,8,Fafter a multi-vehicle crash forced the
OL,9,Fclosure of three out of four lanes on
OL,10,Fthe clockwise carriageway.
OL,12,FThe crash happened at about 06:55 GMT
OL,13,Fbetween junction 11 for Chertsey and
OL,14,Fjunction 12 for Thorpe. One person was
OL,15,Finjured and taken to hospital, Surrey
OL,16,FPolice said.
OL,18,FNational Highways said just after 09:40
OL,19,Fall lanes had reopened.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
