OL,3,GNEWSASevere delays on M25 after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FInrix reported congestion stretched as
OL,7,Ffar back as junction eight for Reigate
OL,8,Ffollowing the crash, but this has since
OL,9,Fcleared.
